Howdy. I am just about finished reformatting the version 7.00 spoilers ASCII
file in TeXinfo, the macro package from the Free Software Foundation. This way
you can run makeinfo on the file to produce stuff you can browse in GNU emacs
(info mode) or using the standalone info browser, as well as run it thru TeX
to produce hardcopy. I haven't tried running it thru TeX, my main purpose was
to get something with info so I could link things together with menus and
cross-references, as well as having an automatically generated index. I'm sure
this would be of use to many others...
